header Reference: https://plantuml.com/style-evolution

footer PlantUML GUI: https://github.com/diosaraiva/plantuml-gui

title Style - CSS-like Element Styling

' ---- Elements ----
caption This is caption

legend
The legend
end legend

object user {
  name = "Dummy"
  id = 123
}

@enduml